        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% Styling Configuration\n    classDef security fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef standard fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;\n    classDef tooling fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px,font-weight:bold;\n    classDef latency fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0288d1,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray: 4 4;\n    classDef blocked fill:#f8cecc,stroke:#b85450,stroke-width:2px,font-weight:bold,color:#b85450;\n    classDef success fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,stroke-width:2px,font-weight:bold,color:#274e13;\n\n    %% Phase 1: Forensic Discovery &amp; Tool Integration\n    subgraph Phase1 [1. Active Forensic Discovery &amp; Ingestion]\n        A[Backlog: Pull Solutioning Story] --&gt; B1[\&quot;Task 1A: Forensic Owner Discovery&lt;br/&gt;• Parse Splunk Header Metadata&lt;br/&gt;• Map Git Repos &amp; CODEOWNERS\&quot;]\n        B1 --&gt; CheckDocs{Are API contracts&lt;br/&gt;available?}\n        CheckDocs -- No / Stale Docs --&gt; B1_Alt[\&quot;Task 1A-Alt: Live Production Forensics&lt;br/&gt;• Inspect Network via Browser DevTools&lt;br/&gt;• Scrape Internal API / Service Portals\&quot;]\n        CheckDocs -- Yes --&gt; B2[\&quot;Task 1B: Schema Contract Ingestion&lt;br/&gt;• Import Swagger / WSDL / GraphQL\&quot;]\n        B1_Alt --&gt; B2\n        B2 --&gt; B3[\&quot;Task 1C: Sandbox Token Provisioning&lt;br/&gt;• Fetch APIGee App Keys / OAuth Tokens\&quot;]\n        B3 --&gt; B4[\&quot;Task 1D: Test Data Profile Acquisition&lt;br/&gt;• Extract Synthetic Mock Payloads\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    %% Phase 2: Evidence-Backed Compliance Gating\n    subgraph Phase2 [2. Runtime Schema Compliance Audit]\n        B4 --&gt; B5[\&quot;Task 1E: Runtime Payload Verification&lt;br/&gt;• Run Test Handshakes in Insomnia&lt;br/&gt;• Validate Observed vs. Documented Schemas\&quot;]\n        B5 --&gt; Gate1{Does Observed Payload&lt;br/&gt;Match Expected Spec?}\n    end\n\n    %% Gating, Branching &amp; Fallbacks\n    subgraph Remediation [3. Defensive Rectification &amp; Escalation]\n        Gate1 -- \&quot;No: Broken Contract\&quot; --&gt; H[\&quot;Task 1F: Alternate Endpoint Evaluation&lt;br/&gt;• Scan Parallel Git Repos &amp; Shared Portals\&quot;]\n        H --&gt; Gate2{Is a viable alternate&lt;br/&gt;API discovered?}\n        Gate2 -- Yes --&gt; B2\n        Gate2 -- No --&gt; J[MARK STORY BLOCKED&lt;br/&gt;Log Evidence &amp; Trigger SLA Escalation]\n    end\n\n    Gate1 -- \&quot;Yes: Verified\&quot; --&gt; G[Proceed to Low-Level Design &amp; DTO Mapping]\n    J --&gt; B1\n\n    %% Element-to-Class Assignment\n    class Gate1,Gate2,CheckDocs security;\n    class B1,B1_Alt,B5,H tooling;\n    class B2,B3,B4 latency;\n    class J blocked;\n    class G success;\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="YzWi15fRR6ia3SfefZE3-1">
